From e4204329f1dddb72deee76bfc51b0adf2cb61d11 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Christian Schaller <cschalle@redhat.com>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 15:03:14 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] software_isp: Add lens shading correction

Backport of the lens shading support written against libcamera master, with a
self-contained algorithm because this release predates libipa's shared
LscAlgorithm. Includes the imx471 tuning data for the Lenovo ThinkPad X1
Carbon Gen 14.
